<html><head><title>How</title>
<meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"></head><body><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px;">As a teacher, you can </span><span style="margin: 0px;">participate</span><span style="margin: 0px;"> in transdisciplinary education in </span><span style="margin: 0px;">various ways</span><span style="margin: 0px;">. You can be an initiator, join an ongoing project, serve as an expert, work as a teacher-researcher, or play a supporting role.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Currently, much transdisciplinary education starts with individual, enthusiastic teachers who set up a project with a strong interest and belief in innovative education. They seek broader support within their institution. Teachers thus function as </span><span style="margin: 0px">the pioneers</span><span style="margin: 0px">.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif"><span style="margin: 0px">Now that more transdisciplinary education projects are </span><span style="margin: 0px">emerging</span><span style="margin: 0px"> everywhere, you can also join existing initiatives or collaborate with other partners. Institution-wide educational events, such as an annual day or education festival, or national education conferences, are good opportunities to connect with other motivated innovators. The same applies to network organizations like Comenius (in het Netherlands) or networking via social media like LinkedIn. Also, look around within your own university for ongoing initiatives, or at other schools in the region.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-US" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">Sometimes, companies and societal organizations themselves approach educational institutions with project proposals. It helps to actively express your interest in developing transdisciplinary education, to increase the chances of being connected to other enthusiasts.</span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div><div style="margin: 0px; font-family: &quot; font-size: 12px&quot;;"><p style="margin: 16px 0px;"><font color="#000000"><span lang="EN-GB" style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;"><span style="margin: 0px">There are </span><span style="margin: 0px">many different ways</span><span style="margin: 0px"> to engage in transdisciplinary education. Throughout the TRAIL, you will learn more about the various phases of transdisciplinary education. Whether you are pioneering alone or joining an existing initiative.</span></span><span style="margin: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 30.225px; font-family: Verdana, Verdana_EmbeddedFont, Verdana_MSFontService, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></font></p></div></body></html>